==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cats]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cats]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~2,000f</sup>.
*8 [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cats]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 33.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 41 seconds<sup>1,230f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cat]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cat]] spawns after 48.33 seconds<sup>1,450f</sup>.
*1 [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cat]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cats]] spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
**2 [[Yakuza Vampire (Enemy)|Yakuza Vampires]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Yakuza Vampire (Enemy)|Yakuza Vampires]] spawn, delay 8~16.67 seconds<sup>240f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any units that can outrange the Yakuza Vampires are very useful here. They don't have strong stats so they shouldn't be any trouble.

